Tadayoshi returned to the government as an assistant of Yoshiakira.
Takauji and Yoshiakira departed for Omi and Harima to subjugate Tadafuyu SASAKI and Yoshisuke AKAMATSU, and in fact, they planned to search and kill Tadayoshi and Tadafuyu, and negotiated with the Southern Court.
Tadayoshi escaped to the Hokuriku region and fled to Kamakura.
Takauji and the Southern Court were established in October of the same year and this was called Shohei Itto (Shohei era).
